# install over a directory it did not install names the id it would adopt under
$ skills install --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml --source-root <WORLD>/overlay/skills (in demo)
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
error: skills install: .claude/skills/by-directory already exists and was not installed by skills install (it has no install record in .labdrian/procedural-skills.lock.json); if it is exactly the current skill, run `labdrian skills adopt --project-id demo` to take ownership of it, otherwise move it away
error: skills install: .agents/skills/by-directory already exists and was not installed by skills install (it has no install record in .labdrian/procedural-skills.lock.json); if it is exactly the current skill, run `labdrian skills adopt --project-id demo` to take ownership of it, otherwise move it away
error: skills install: refused, so nothing was installed

# adopt of a skill that is in one runtime only notes where it is not, under the id
$ skills adopt --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml --source-root <WORLD>/overlay/skills (in demo)
